/**
 * @defgroup MCC_Pitch Pitch
 * @ingroup MCC
 * @brief Written pitch primitives: letters, accidentals and pitch classes.
 *
 * `MCC::Letter` + `MCC::Accidental` form a `MCC::PitchClass`, which keeps
 * its written spelling. `MCC::ChromaticClass` discards the spelling and is
 * obtained explicitly through `PitchClass::ChromaticClass()`. Written
 * equality and enharmonic equivalence are separate operations; see
 * @ref MCC_Specification.
 *
 * All types are trivially copyable, allocation-free and `constexpr`.
 * Available when `MCC_PITCH` is defined.
 */
